     Even if you could control when Magicbane delivered its
cancel effect, that cancellation attempt can be resisted too.
And it's actually a little more likely to be resisted than
the wand's attack is.

     She has a base level of 20 but will probably be created
at level 21 due to dungeon depth, and her resistance factor
is 50.  The resistance formula is simple but yields a somewhat
convoluted result.  Medusa with experience level 21 will have
50/91 chance (~55%) to resist the wand and 50/89 chance (~56%)
to resist the artifact weapon.  (The hero's experience level
is a factor when using the spell of cancellation, but not
when using either item.)


